[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11226.87, "timestamp": "03:07:06", "text": "良い。えっと、私は完全にぎっしり詰まっています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11228.67, "timestamp": "03:07:08", "text": "人々の数を見てください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11232.23, "timestamp": "03:07:12", "text": "明日出発します。今日4人目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11234.469, "timestamp": "03:07:14", "text": "明日。 3人。翌日"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11236.71, "timestamp": "03:07:16", "text": "明日、さらに３人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11238.95, "timestamp": "03:07:18", "text": "木曜日、3人。金曜日、3"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11241.429, "timestamp": "03:07:21", "text": "人々。土曜日、3人。日曜日、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11244.15, "timestamp": "03:07:24", "text": "2人。月曜日、2人。火曜日、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11247.429, "timestamp": "03:07:27", "text": "2人。いいえ、一人だけです。水曜日、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11248.349, "timestamp": "03:07:28", "text": "三つ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11250.71, "timestamp": "03:07:30", "text": "人々。そろそろ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11253.51, "timestamp": "03:07:33", "text": "人々。ああ、神様、私は人々を必要としています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11256.309, "timestamp": "03:07:36", "text": "ああ、大変だ、人を配置する必要がある。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11258.55, "timestamp": "03:07:38", "text": "実際、人手が足りなくなってきているんです。待って、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11261.505, "timestamp": "03:07:41", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lolol"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11262.71, "timestamp": "03:07:42", "text": "そこには何もありませんでした。だから、一護と一護と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11265.429, "timestamp": "03:07:45", "text": "ああ、ネオガミ、彼を捕まえなきゃ。一護"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11268.469, "timestamp": "03:07:48", "text": "そして神話級。人員を配置する必要がある。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11271.269, "timestamp": "03:07:51", "text": "アクマは6月4日以降に教えてくれるだろう。彼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11276.23, "timestamp": "03:07:56", "text": "返事すらしてないよ、兄弟。えーと、オエン"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11279.07, "timestamp": "03:07:59", "text": "6月。 15位です。彼に聞いてみます"}]